Package: pkgdowntemplate
Title: Shared pkgdown House Style for the rwhite.no R Packages
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
  person(c("Richard","Aubrey"), "White", email = "hello@rwhite.no", role = c("aut", "cre"),
    comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-6747-1726"))
  )
Description: A pkgdown template package that gives every rwhite.no package a
    consistent Bootstrap 5 house style: Newsreader + Source Sans 3 typography,
    the warm brand-red palette, a light editorial navbar with a packages
    switcher, and a common footer. Packages opt in with
    template: { package: pkgdowntemplate } in their own _pkgdown.yml.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
URL: https://www.rwhite.no/pkgdowntemplate/, https://github.com/raubreywhite/pkgdowntemplate
BugReports: https://github.com/raubreywhite/pkgdowntemplate/issues
Encoding: UTF-8
Config/Needs/website: pkgdown
